  "source_code": "t = int(input())\r\nfor k in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = sorted(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    N = 3*n\r\n    p = [0]*(N+1)\r\n    for i in range(N):\r\n        p[i+1]=p[i]+a[i]\r\n    ans=0\r\n    l=n\r\n    for k in range(n+1):\r\n        l = min(l,n-k)\r\n        while l>0 and a[N-k-2*l] + a[N-k-2*l+1] < 3*a[2*k+l-1]:\r\n            l-=1\r\n        cur = (3*p[N]\r\n              +3*(p[N] - p[N-k])\r\n              + p[N-k] - p[N-k-2*l]\r\n              - 3*p[2*k+l])\r\n        ans = max(ans,cur)\r\n    print(ans)",
